# 仓库内文本文件一律以 LF 存储（scripts/fix-line-endings.mjs 也按 LF 维护）。
# 不加这条的话，Windows 上 core.autocrlf 会把检出内容变成 CRLF，与脚本的约定互相打架。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.pmz binary
*.wasm binary
